Package: modbus-poller
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: modbus-poller pilot <root@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libmodbus5 (>= 3.1.6), libcjson1 (>= 1.7.13)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Modbus TCP polling service with a Unix socket API
 modbus-pollerd polls the Modbus TCP devices described in
 /etc/modbus-poller/config.json, one thread and one connection per device,
 and keeps their latest engineering values in memory. Client applications
 read them over /run/modbus-poller/poller.sock (group modbus-poller) with
 newline-delimited JSON, or through the modbus-poller-sdk Python package.
